  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(4 fotos) EL Ayuntamiento de Ribesalbes ha repartido m&aacute;s de 2000 azulejos en la Cabalgata del &#39;Preg&oacute;&#39; de las fiestas de la Magdalena de Castell&oacute;.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/RibesalbesPregoMagdalena3.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 233px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">La carroza, adem&aacute;s de contar con la presencia de la reina,&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Alejandra Fern&aacute;ndez Albalat, y su corte de honor, ha mostrado la elaboraci&oacute;n de alfarer&iacute;a tradicional a cargo de Lino Traver.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/TaulellRibesalbesPregoMagdalena.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Los azulejos conmemorativos, que reproducen el cartel de las fiestas, han sido</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;donados por la empresa Cer&aacute;mica Ribesalbes.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ribesalbespregomagdalena18/ribesalbespregomagdalena1.jpg\" alt=\"ribesalbespregomagdalena1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ribesalbespregomagdalena18/ribesalbespregomagdalena2.jpg\" alt=\"ribesalbespregomagdalena2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ribesalbespregomagdalena18/ribesalbespregomagdalena3.jpg\" alt=\"ribesalbespregomagdalena3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ribesalbespregomagdalena18/taulellribesalbespregomagdalena.jpg\" alt=\"taulellribesalbespregomagdalena\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
